  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>Studio Two, EMI Studios, Abbey Road<br>\nProducer: <a href=\"/people/george-martin/\">George Martin</a><br>\nEngineer: <a href=\"/people/norman-smith/\">Norman Smith</a></p><p>The Beatles had recorded <a href=\"/songs/day-tripper/\">‘Day Tripper’</a> at Abbey Road on <a href=\"/1965/10/16/recording-day-tripper-if-i-needed-someone/\">16 October 1965</a>. Four days later they began work on the other song on the double a-side single, <a href=\"/songs/we-can-work-it-out/\">‘We Can Work It Out’</a>. <span id=\"more-4616\"></span></p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1965/10/20/recording-we-can-work-it-out/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-4616 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/usa_we_can_work_it_out/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"196\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_we_can_work_it_out-200x196.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"We Can Work It Out single artwork - USA\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_we_can_work_it_out-200x196.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_we_can_work_it_out-580x570.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_we_can_work_it_out-960x943.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_we_can_work_it_out-768x754.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_we_can_work_it_out-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_we_can_work_it_out.jpg 1000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"10270\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/releases/usa_we_can_work_it_out/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/usa_we_can_work_it_out.jpg\" da